# Host-local build / acquisition output. Kept out of git AND out of the npm
# tarball: npm-packlist honors a directory's .gitignore when no .npmignore is
# present, so these never ship inside the bundled @domotion/text-engine. The
# runtime acquires a version-checked companion instead (icu-helper-acquire.ts).
build/
domotion-icu
domotion-icu.exe
icudtl.dat
*.dll
